{
    "title": "Through the Word",
    "description": "UNDERSTAND THE BIBLE IN JUST TEN MINUTES A DAY, with plans for every book and audio guides for every chapter.\r\n\r\nThrough the Word is a guided audio journey through the entire Bible, one chapter at a time - with no ads, no fees, ever. Every day, more than 150,000 people around the world trust TTW for their daily Bible habit. Read their stories below!\r\n\r\nYOUR DAILY BIBLE HABIT\r\n\r\nSimple. Bible. Habit. One chapter today, next chapter tomorrow.\r\n\r\nBIBLE ON YOUR SCREEN, TEACHER IN YOUR HEADPHONES\r\n\r\nEvery audio guide walks you through one Bible chapter with clear explanation and insightful application.\r\n\r\nUNDERSTAND THE BIBLE TOGETHER\r\n\r\nNew in 4.0! TTW Together is now available for every Bible book, journey, and topical plan. Start or join a group today!\r\n\r\nFREE FOREVER & 10 MINUTES A DAY\r\n\r\nNo fees and no ads. TTW fits a busy schedule, making it easy to listen on the road, while you work out, or whatever fits your daily routine\u2026 anytime, anywhere, even offline.\r\n\r\nAUDIO GUIDES FOR EVERY CHAPTER\r\n\r\nFrom Genesis to Revelation, walk through all 1,189 chapters in about 10 minutes each with clear explanations for every chapter.\r\n\r\n19 EPIC JOURNEYS THROUGH THE BIBLE\r\n\r\nThe Bible can seem daunting, so TTW has broken it down into 19 journeys, guiding you step-by-step through books, themes, and chronology with a great balance between Old and New Testaments.\r\n\r\nTHE CURE FOR LOST-IN-LEVITICUS SYNDROME\r\n\r\nHave you ever started a Bible reading plan, but got bogged down in Leviticus or Numbers? TTW\u2019s simple plan keeps you moving, and our teachers even make the boring chapters interesting!\r\n\r\nGUIDES FOR BIBLE CURIOUS TO BIBLE PROS\r\n\r\nNew to the Bible? Try the 26-day \u201cStart\u201d journey. Been reading for a while now? TTW has more than 1,200 audio guides covering every Bible chapter, with insight and application for every level.\r\n\r\nTHOUSANDS OF 5-STAR REVIEWS AND LISTENER STORIES\r\n\r\n\u201c\u2026 Today (Oct 20, 2023) we officially completed 1,288 days straight going through each chapter of each book of the Bible\u2026 we have truly become a band of brothers. We\u2019ve seen miraculous answers to prayer\u2026 we have become a band of brothers who rally daily around God's Word\u2026 You have been an anchor for us.\" \u2013JD Hornbacher (and the \"Bible with the Guys\" group) (Oct 20, 2023)\r\n\r\n\u201c\u2026 TTW has changed my life completely. It made the Bible come alive\u2026 Now that I listen before sleeping, I have no trouble keeping the Bible habit\u2026 ending the day with my head and thoughts resting and thinking about through the word.\u201d \u2013Christina Thorkildsen (October 9, 2023)\r\n\r\n\u201cWe do our homeschool Bible class with TTW\u2026 Always excellent! Always a blessing. We are die-hard TTW fans\u2026 And we love you all!\u201d \u2013Kate Russo Thompson (October 3, 2023)\r\n\r\n\u201cI have been a Christian for many years\u2026 I learn something new every day. It\u2019s awesome! So thankful Kris and company obeyed the Lord in this incredible undertaking.\u201d \u2013paigebontrager (September 15, 2023)\r\n\r\n\u201c\u2026 never have I experienced the Bible in this kind of way! Since I downloaded and signed into the app\u2026 It feels really great to be excited about God's Word!\u201d \u2013Misty H (September 8, 2023)\r\n\r\nFind even more stories at https://throughtheword.org/stories/",
    "descriptionHTML": "UNDERSTAND THE BIBLE IN JUST TEN MINUTES A DAY, with plans for every book and audio guides for every chapter.<br><br>Through the Word is a guided audio journey through the entire Bible, one chapter at a time - with no ads, no fees, ever. Every day, more than 150,000 people around the world trust TTW for their daily Bible habit. Read their stories below!<br><br>YOUR DAILY BIBLE HABIT<br><br>Simple. Bible. Habit. One chapter today, next chapter tomorrow.<br><br>BIBLE ON YOUR SCREEN, TEACHER IN YOUR HEADPHONES<br><br>Every audio guide walks you through one Bible chapter with clear explanation and insightful application.<br><br>UNDERSTAND THE BIBLE TOGETHER<br><br>New in 4.0! TTW Together is now available for every Bible book, journey, and topical plan. Start or join a group today!<br><br>FREE FOREVER &amp; 10 MINUTES A DAY<br><br>No fees and no ads. TTW fits a busy schedule, making it easy to listen on the road, while you work out, or whatever fits your daily routine\u2026 anytime, anywhere, even offline.<br><br>AUDIO GUIDES FOR EVERY CHAPTER<br><br>From Genesis to Revelation, walk through all 1,189 chapters in about 10 minutes each with clear explanations for every chapter.<br><br>19 EPIC JOURNEYS THROUGH THE BIBLE<br><br>The Bible can seem daunting, so TTW has broken it down into 19 journeys, guiding you step-by-step through books, themes, and chronology with a great balance between Old and New Testaments.<br><br>THE CURE FOR LOST-IN-LEVITICUS SYNDROME<br><br>Have you ever started a Bible reading plan, but got bogged down in Leviticus or Numbers? TTW\u2019s simple plan keeps you moving, and our teachers even make the boring chapters interesting!<br><br>GUIDES FOR BIBLE CURIOUS TO BIBLE PROS<br><br>New to the Bible? Try the 26-day \u201cStart\u201d journey. Been reading for a while now? TTW has more than 1,200 audio guides covering every Bible chapter, with insight and application for every level.<br><br>THOUSANDS OF 5-STAR REVIEWS AND LISTENER STORIES<br><br>\u201c\u2026 Today (Oct 20, 2023) we officially completed 1,288 days straight going through each chapter of each book of the Bible\u2026 we have truly become a band of brothers. We\u2019ve seen miraculous answers to prayer\u2026 we have become a band of brothers who rally daily around God&#39;s Word\u2026 You have been an anchor for us.&quot; \u2013JD Hornbacher (and the &quot;Bible with the Guys&quot; group) (Oct 20, 2023)<br><br>\u201c\u2026 TTW has changed my life completely. It made the Bible come alive\u2026 Now that I listen before sleeping, I have no trouble keeping the Bible habit\u2026 ending the day with my head and thoughts resting and thinking about through the word.\u201d \u2013Christina Thorkildsen (October 9, 2023)<br><br>\u201cWe do our homeschool Bible class with TTW\u2026 Always excellent! Always a blessing. We are die-hard TTW fans\u2026 And we love you all!\u201d \u2013Kate Russo Thompson (October 3, 2023)<br><br>\u201cI have been a Christian for many years\u2026 I learn something new every day. It\u2019s awesome! So thankful Kris and company obeyed the Lord in this incredible undertaking.\u201d \u2013paigebontrager (September 15, 2023)<br><br>\u201c\u2026 never have I experienced the Bible in this kind of way! Since I downloaded and signed into the app\u2026 It feels really great to be excited about God&#39;s Word!\u201d \u2013Misty H (September 8, 2023)<br><br>Find even more stories at https://throughtheword.org/stories/",
